 - Power                                                                    1 ●
   ● awake  off  the Mac sleeps as macOS decides  a awake
 - Guards                                                                   4 ●
   ● battery    80% · AC attached  ends a session at 20% on battery
   ● low power  off                ends a session when it turns on
   ● thermal    nominal            ends a session at serious, or heavy for 5m…
   ● lid        open               closing it on battery ends a --lid session…
